# CODEOWNERS — review ownership for this multi-product monorepo.
#
# Two products live here:
#   - hirely          (apps/api, apps/web)          — outreach / CRM
#   - career-platform (apps/career-*, packages/career-*) — reverse-recruiting marketplace
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so order matters: broad defaults first,
# product-specific paths after, jointly-owned shared config last.
#
# NOTE: this repo (jadewale/hirely) is a personal repo, so only individual
# usernames work here and CODEOWNERS is advisory (auto-assigns reviewers).
# When this moves under a GitHub org, swap the @jadewale placeholders for
# team handles (e.g. @your-org/hirely, @your-org/career) and turn on branch
# protection with "Require review from Code Owners" to make it a hard gate.

# ── Default owner for everything not matched below ──────────────────────────
*                               @jadewale

# ── hirely product ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/apps/api/                      @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely
/apps/web/                      @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely

# ── career-platform product ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/apps/career-api/               @jadewale   # → @your-org/career
/apps/career-web/               @jadewale   # → @your-org/career
/packages/career-config/        @jadewale   # → @your-org/career
/packages/career-contracts/     @jadewale   # → @your-org/career
/packages/career-db/            @jadewale   # → @your-org/career
/packages/career-testing/       @jadewale   # → @your-org/career

# ── Shared / cross-cutting (jointly owned — change deliberately) ─────────────
# Root config, shared config packages, and infra affect BOTH products.
# Requiring both teams here is the guardrail that keeps one team from
# breaking the other via a root-level change.
/package.json                   @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/turbo.json                     @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/bun.lock                       @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/.github/                       @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/packages/eslint-config/        @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/packages/typescript-config/    @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
/packages/terraform-aws/        @jadewale   # → @your-org/hirely @your-org/career
